    "name": "The Odyssey of Commander Cookie",
    "steam_appid": 3812320,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Odyssey of Commander Cookie</strong> unfolds across <strong>three unlockable chapters</strong>, each with its own distinct gameplay mode. Complete one, and you'll unlock the next, building toward a full-scale cat fight on the mice empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2d <strong>Guardian Killer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless waves of increasingly powerful mice ships as you battle your way toward one of the three <strong>Planetary Guardians</strong>. Create unique builds using a variety of ships, weapons, cat pilots, and special ability cards. Survive long enough, and you'll earn the chance to challenge one of the guardians. <br><strong><i>Do you have what it takes to face the guardians?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/de79cc7fe86efdc362fcbc5c44851163.poster.avif?t=1753383310\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/de79cc7fe86efdc362fcbc5c44851163.webm?t=1753383310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/de79cc7fe86efdc362fcbc5c44851163.mp4?t=1753383310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca3 Payload\u00a0(</strong>Planned for a future update<strong>)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escort the <strong>P.U.R.R.</strong> (<i>Payload: Universal Rat Remover</i>) through the fortified districts of the city of <strong>Verminax.</strong> Fend off escalating waves of resistance as you push the weapon to the very heart of the mouse technocracy.<br><strong><i>One way in. No way back!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/3270ec001d65d707871b21dfddff605c.poster.avif?t=1753383310\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/3270ec001d65d707871b21dfddff605c.webm?t=1753383310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/3270ec001d65d707871b21dfddff605c.mp4?t=1753383310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Extraction (</strong>Planned for a future update<strong>)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the P.U.R.R. deployed, it's a race against time to navigate your ship through the explosive chaos of the planetary annihilation and reach the extraction point before the blast consumes everything.<br><strong><i>Survival isn't guaranteed, just highly recommended.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/4a2e61df95d39407405fad0fef217de6.webp?t=1753383310\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your loadout from a roster of unlockable cats, ships, and weapons. Mix and match to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each run, collect resources by defeating enemies and destroying the environment. Once enough resources have been gathered, the mothership will reward you with upgrade beacons. Activating them, lets you choose from three upgrade paths: <strong>Armory</strong>, <strong>Defense</strong>, or <strong>Tech</strong>. These upgrades function like ability cards, with dozens of unique effects from status boosts to powerful new abilities, letting you craft a one-of-a-kind build every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As difficulty ramps up, optional <strong>mini-challenges</strong> appear. Complete them to earn <strong>ship modules, </strong>powerful active perks that trigger once you hit a certain kill multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the perfect build, adapt on the fly, and survive the escalating onslaught in classic roguelite fashion, feline style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/a4327243a6fe0b9aa46fadc207933ebd.poster.avif?t=1753383310\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/a4327243a6fe0b9aa46fadc207933ebd.webm?t=1753383310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/a4327243a6fe0b9aa46fadc207933ebd.mp4?t=1753383310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Builds:</strong> With dozens of different upgrades to choose from, no two attempts will ever be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship-Modules system:</strong> Improve your skills and <strong>earn active, powerful abilities</strong> by completing mini-challenges. Unlock <strong>ship modules</strong> that provide unique, game-changing perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Cast &amp; Arsenal:</strong> Mix and match across a <strong>wide variety of unlockable characters, ships, and weapons</strong> to find the perfect combination for your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick Up And Play:</strong> Designed for quick 15-20 minute runs, perfect for fast, action-packed sessions that fit right into your day.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/75e4eabc4829f87647eec6510b2c1c3c.avif?t=1753383310\" width=616 height=347 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/4a2e61df95d39407405fad0fef217de6.webp?t=1753383310\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Odyssey of Commander Cookie</strong> unfolds across <strong>three unlockable chapters</strong>, each with its own distinct gameplay mode. Complete one, and you'll unlock the next, building toward a full-scale cat fight on the mice empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2d <strong>Guardian Killer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless waves of increasingly powerful mice ships as you battle your way toward one of the three <strong>Planetary Guardians</strong>. Create unique builds using a variety of ships, weapons, cat pilots, and special ability cards. Survive long enough, and you'll earn the chance to challenge one of the guardians. <br><strong><i>Do you have what it takes to face the guardians?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/de79cc7fe86efdc362fcbc5c44851163.poster.avif?t=1753383310\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/de79cc7fe86efdc362fcbc5c44851163.webm?t=1753383310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/de79cc7fe86efdc362fcbc5c44851163.mp4?t=1753383310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca3 Payload\u00a0(</strong>Planned for a future update<strong>)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escort the <strong>P.U.R.R.</strong> (<i>Payload: Universal Rat Remover</i>) through the fortified districts of the city of <strong>Verminax.</strong> Fend off escalating waves of resistance as you push the weapon to the very heart of the mouse technocracy.<br><strong><i>One way in. No way back!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vide