aft a one-of-a-kind build every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As difficulty ramps up, optional <strong>mini-challenges</strong> appear. Complete them to earn <strong>ship modules, </strong>powerful active perks that trigger once you hit a certain kill multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the perfect build, adapt on the fly, and survive the escalating onslaught in classic roguelite fashion, feline style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/a4327243a6fe0b9aa46fadc207933ebd.poster.avif?t=1753383310\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/a4327243a6fe0b9aa46fadc207933ebd.webm?t=1753383310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/a4327243a6fe0b9aa46fadc207933ebd.mp4?t=1753383310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Builds:</strong> With dozens of different upgrades to choose from, no two attempts will ever be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship-Modules system:</strong> Improve your skills and <strong>earn active, powerful abilities</strong> by completing mini-challenges. Unlock <strong>ship modules</strong> that provide unique, game-changing perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Cast &amp; Arsenal:</strong> Mix and match across a <strong>wide variety of unlockable characters, ships, and weapons</strong> to find the perfect combination for your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick Up And Play:</strong> Designed for quick 15-20 minute runs, perfect for fast, action-packed sessions that fit right into your day.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/75e4eabc4829f87647eec6510b2c1c3c.avif?t=1753383310\" width=616 height=347 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812320/extras/4a2e61df95d39407405fad0fef217de6.webp?t=1753383310\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Take command of the PSS, Paw Space Squadron, and catfight your way through relentless swarms of cybermice. Scavenge their tech. Upgrade your ship and weapons and unlock a fleet of fellow cat heroes, as you claw your way to victory in this intense roguelite twin-stick shooter.",
